    "# Assignment No.6 — Phrase-Based SMT for Myanmar Grapheme-to-Phoneme (G2P)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Course:** AI Fundamental Class (Class 13 & 14)\n",
    "**Task:** Use Phrase-based Statistical Machine Translation (Moses SMT) to convert Myanmar\n",
    "grapheme sequences (syllable-segmented Myanmar script) into IPA-style phoneme sequences,\n",
    "based on the `myG2P` corpus.\n",
    "\n",
    "- Source: https://github.com/ye-kyaw-thu/myG2P\n",
    "- Tutorial code/data: https://github.com/ye-kyaw-thu/AIE-F/tree/main/slide-code/class-13and14\n",
    "- SMT framework: Moses (binary release `ubuntu-17.04.tgz`)\n",
    "  https://www.statmt.org/moses-release/RELEASE-4.0/binaries/\n",
    "\n",
    "Both translation directions were trained and evaluated:\n",
    "- **my → ph** (Myanmar grapheme → phoneme)\n",
    "- **ph → my** (phoneme → Myanmar grapheme)\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "3356ee20",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
